RL: Well, you know, I-- whenever I say that, that's my-- my-- my only memory of any restrictions, other than the fact that we were just housebound for so long. But then came the good times, when we got out of Germany. And I don't know if you want me to talk about that now, but I remember that very well.

INT: Before we get into that, I just want to know, do you know anything about, like, how they, your family, received permission to leave Germany?

